 | 0x7b | gettp dst | Materialize the tls-pointer |
+| 0xb8 | bcopy dst_addr src_addr width | Copy bytes: `RAM[dst + i] := RAM[src + i]` |
+| 0xba | bzero dst_addr width | Zero bytes: `RAM[dst + i] := 0` |
 | 0x01 | .mem name alignment mem_kind | Add new mem region to unit |
